{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "ctfkit",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/compliancetf/ctfkit",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "ctf.coverage.module_source",
              "name": "coverage.module_source",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Module sources outside compliance.tf endpoints, and raw resources a compliance.tf module covers"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Module sources outside compliance.tf endpoints, and raw resources a compliance.tf module covers"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Module sources outside compliance.tf endpoints, and raw resources a compliance.tf module covers. When the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes. Documentation: https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#module-source-coverage",
                "markdown": "**Module sources outside compliance.tf endpoints, and raw resources a compliance.tf module covers.**\n\n### When the finding is intended\n\nWhen the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes.\n\n```yaml\nexceptions:\n  - rule: ctf.coverage.module_source\n    resource: <address in the finding>\n    justification: <why>\n    approved_by: <approver>\n    review_date: \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n[ctfkit by compliance.tf: rule reference](https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#module-source-coverage)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#module-source-coverage",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "compliance",
                  "terraform",
                  "coverage"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ctf.policy.tagging",
              "name": "policy.tagging",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A resource is missing tags the organisation requires"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A resource is missing tags the organisation requires"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A resource is missing tags the organisation requires. When the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes. Documentation: https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#tagging",
                "markdown": "**A resource is missing tags the organisation requires.**\n\n### When the finding is intended\n\nWhen the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes.\n\n```yaml\nexceptions:\n  - rule: ctf.policy.tagging\n    resource: <address in the finding>\n    justification: <why>\n    approved_by: <approver>\n    review_date: \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n[ctfkit by compliance.tf: rule reference](https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#tagging)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#tagging",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "compliance",
                  "terraform",
                  "policy"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.0"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "ctf.coverage.module_source",
          "level": "error",
          "kind": "fail",
          "message": {
            "text": "Raw aws_sqs_queue where the compliance.tf module soc2.compliance.tf/terraform-aws-modules/sqs/aws exists"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "main.tf"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1,
                  "endLine": 3
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "aws_sqs_queue.untagged",
                  "kind": "resource"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "ctfkitFindingHash/v1": "643857f70935cbc0d194c8c08e114c820ad8388bf2b9a5be1114bcd540fd3fc3"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ctf.schema": "1.0",
            "ctf.stage": "post_plan",
            "ctf.controlIds": [],
            "ctf.frameworks": [],
            "ctf.preventive": true,
            "ctf.evidence": {
              "runId": "ctfkit-fixture-run",
              "commit": "0000000000000000000000000000000000000000",
              "signature": null
            },
            "ctf.remediation": {
              "moduleSource": "soc2.compliance.tf/terraform-aws-modules/sqs/aws",
              "version": "~> 4.0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "ctf.policy.tagging",
          "level": "warning",
          "kind": "fail",
          "message": {
            "text": "aws_sqs_queue.untagged is missing required tags Environment, Owner"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
